[
  {
    "text": "It's wildly selfish",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 1.26
  },
  {
    "text": "to spot a loving,",
    "start": 1.26,
    "end": 2.78
  },
  {
    "text": "cheerful, genuine person",
    "start": 2.78,
    "end": 4.62
  },
  {
    "text": "and think, nice,",
    "start": 4.62,
    "end": 5.92
  },
  {
    "text": "a peaceful life to ruin",
    "start": 5.92,
    "end": 7.2
  },
  {
    "text": "with my trauma.",
    "start": 7.2,
    "end": 8.48
  },
  {
    "text": "You saw their light,",
    "start": 8.48,
    "end": 9.7
  },
  {
    "text": "and instead of protecting it,",
    "start": 9.7,
    "end": 11.16
  },
  {
    "text": "you went full emotional vampire",
    "start": 11.16,
    "end": 12.66
  },
  {
    "text": "and drained it.",
    "start": 12.66,
    "end": 14.06
  },
  {
    "text": "You dumped your chaos",
    "start": 14.06,
    "end": 15.24
  },
  {
    "text": "into their calm,",
    "start": 15.24,
    "end": 16.58
  },
  {
    "text": "and had the nerve",
    "start": 16.58,
    "end": 17.32
  },
  {
    "text": "to call it connection.",
    "start": 17.32,
    "end": 18.86
  },
  {
    "text": "Spoiler, that's not love.",
    "start": 18.86,
    "end": 20.4
  },
  {
    "text": "That's using someone",
    "start": 20.4,
    "end": 21.1
  },
  {
    "text": "as a human band-aid",
    "start": 21.1,
    "end": 22.42
  },
  {
    "text": "for wounds you're too lazy",
    "start": 22.42,
    "end": 23.8
  },
  {
    "text": "to heal.",
    "start": 23.8,
    "end": 24.64
  },
  {
    "text": "The darkest part,",
    "start": 24.64,
    "end": 25.52
  },
  {
    "text": "they were perfectly fine",
    "start": 25.52,
    "end": 26.66
  },
  {
    "text": "before you spawned.",
    "start": 26.66,
    "end": 27.46
  },
  {
    "text": "So if you're not ready,",
    "start": 27.46,
    "end": 29.02
  },
  {
    "text": "leave people alone.",
    "start": 29.02,
    "end": 30.12
  },
  {
    "text": "Go heal what's broken",
    "start": 30.12,
    "end": 31.1
  },
  {
    "text": "before you hand your damage",
    "start": 31.1,
    "end": 32.48
  },
  {
    "text": "to someone else,",
    "start": 32.48,
    "end": 33.62
  },
  {
    "text": "because the piece of them",
    "start": 33.62,
    "end": 34.5
  },
  {
    "text": "you kill might stay dead forever.",
    "start": 34.5,
    "end": 36.7
  }
]